ent": "L'apprenant comprend de l'information simple dans des conversations \u00e0 un d\u00e9bit lent concernant des sujets communicatifs et le vocabulaire de ce niveau.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la blouse", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une sorte de corsage f\u00e9minin \u00e0 manches", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Elle s'ach\u00e8te une blouse et un chemisier.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le07ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots qu'on peut employer quand on fait les magasins.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la jupe", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un v\u00eatement f\u00e9minin qui couvre les jambes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Marie aime cette jupe grise.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le07ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "les lunettes de soleil", "type": "name"}, {"content": "des lunettes noires qui prot\u00e8gent contre la lumi\u00e8re du soleil", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ces lunettes de soleil sont utiles.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le07ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "les soldes", "type": "name"}, {"content": "des marchandises qu'on vend \u00e0 un prix r\u00e9duit", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Faire les soldes est son passe-temps pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le07ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "le monde", "type": "name"}, {"content": "les gens", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il y a beaucoup de monde au Forum des Halles.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le07ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "s'amuser", "type": "name"}, {"content": "passer le temps d'une mani\u00e8re agr\u00e9able ; se divertir", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ils s'amusent bien avec leurs amis au caf\u00e9.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le07ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "penser \u00e0", "type": "name"}, {"content": "r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Vous pensez aux soldes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le07ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "frn2le07ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Les voyelles [i], [y] et [u]", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Les voyelles [i], [y] et [u] sont des voyelles ferm\u00e9es.</br><span class=\"bullet\">Pour prononcer ces voyelles, on n'ouvre la bouche que l\u00e9g\u00e8rement.</br><span class=\"bullet\">[y] et [u] sont des voyelles arrondies, tandis que [i] ne l'est pas.</br><span class=\"bullet\">On prononce [y] et [u] en arrondissant les l\u00e8vres de plus en plus, \u00e0 partir de la base que repr\u00e9sente [i].</br>On prononce les mots dans le tableau ci-dessous identiquement, \u00e0 l'exception pr\u00e8s des voyelles [i], [y] et [u].", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[i]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[y]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"[u]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lu \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"loup    \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ri \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rue\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"roue\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"vie\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"vue\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"vous\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "populaire", "type": "name"}, {"content": "plein de gens ; aim\u00e9 par les gens ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il y a des boutiques populaires au Forum.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le07ob04aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "beaucoup", "type": "name"}, {"content": "en grande quantit\u00e9", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Tu aimes beaucoup tes nouvelles chaussures.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le07ob04aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "\u00e0 mon/ton/son/etc. go\u00fbt", "type": "name"}, {"content": "en ce qui me/te/le/etc. concerne ; ce qui me/te/lui/etc. pla\u00eet", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ce grand magasin est trop cher \u00e0 leur go\u00fbt.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le07ob04aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Mettez les mots avec les voyelles [i], [y] et [u] du tableau ci-dessous en ordre alphab\u00e9tique.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Prononcez ces mots \u00e0 voix haute avec votre camarade.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Trouvez 2 autres mots avec chacune des voyelles [i], [y] et [u] sur Internet ou dans un dictionnaire.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ajoutez les nouveaux mots au tableau. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":6,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">[i]</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"intelligent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"admirable\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"amie\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">[y]</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"us\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tenue\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"capuchon\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">[u]</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"oublier\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"genou\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cousin\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": " J'organise et dis des mots alphab\u00e9tiquement. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je prononce les voyelles [i], [y] et [u]. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je cherche dans le dictionnaire et \u00e9cris 6 nouveaux mots avec les voyelles [i], [y] et [u]. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "frn2le07ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "frn2le07ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "frn2le07ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Coraline</span> : Qu'est-ce qui ne va pas, Pierre ? Tu n'as pas l'air de beaucoup t'amuser !<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : Coraline, je n'aime pas du tout faire les magasins. Il y a trop de monde et je d\u00e9teste faire la queue.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Coraline</span> : Mais pense \u00e0 ton nouveau costume et ta nouvelle cravate ! Ils sont si magnifiques.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : C'est vrai. Mais il y a tant de boutiques ! Elles se ressemblent toutes apr\u00e8s un certain point."}, {"image": "frn2le07ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "20900", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Coraline</span> : Moi, par contre, je suis super contente. J'adore mon nouveau pull et mes nouvelles lunettes de soleil."}, {"image": "frn2le07ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "27000", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : Le Forum des Halles est beaucoup trop populaire \u00e0 mon go\u00fbt !<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Coraline</span> : Oui, mais on peut y faire de bonnes affaires.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : Peut-\u00eatre. Mais regarde par exemple cette boutique-ci. Tu vois ? Tout y est tellement cher."}, {"image": "frn2le07ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 4, "time": "40700", "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Coraline</span> : Pourtant, il y a de si beaux v\u00eatements : des chaussures, des jupes et des blouses. J'adore tous les articles de cette boutique !<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Pierre</span> : D'accord, \u00e7a va. Tu es incorrigible. Peut-on aller Chez Nanette maintenant ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Coraline</span> : Dis donc ! Aurais-tu faim et soif d'avoir tant couru les magasins ?<br/>"}], "coverimg": "frn2le07ob04re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Je peux prononcer les sons  [i], [y] et [u] comme dans \"Il n'aime pas du tout cette boutique\".", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de ce que j'adore et de ce que je d\u00e9teste.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Quel est le nom de votre boutique pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e&nbsp? Quel genre de boutique est-ce&nbsp?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Combien de centres commerciaux ou de grands magasins y a-t-il dans votre quartier ? Y allez-vous souvent ?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Je peux dire quels sont les go\u00fbts et les d\u00e9go\u00fbts des gens.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade : ", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Coin prononciation : Coraline adore faire les soldes. Pierre d\u00e9teste courir les magasins. Et vous ?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [2], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Caroline et Pierre font les magasins. <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">Pierre n'est pas du tout content.</span> D\u00e9couvrons pourquoi&nbsp;!", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Quelque chose ne va pas. Essayez encore une fois !", "type": "text"}, {"content": "La prochaine fois peut-\u00eatre.", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Parfait !"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": [{"content": "Dans cette phrase les voyelles [i], [y] et [u] dans les mots <span class=\"italic\">\"Pierre\", \"du\"</span> et <span class=\"italic\">\"tout\"</span> sont tr\u00e8s proches les unes des autres. Faites attention \u00e0 leur prononciation !", "type": "text", "tip_id": 0}], "type": "tips"}, {"contents": [{"content": "\nConsignes : Appuyez sur le bouton pour \u00e9couter l'enregistrement audio.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "type": "STI", "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}]}, {"id": 2, "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Entra\u00eenons-nous \u00e0 discriminer et prononcer les voyelles [i], [y] et [u] !", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Activity 1", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Vous avez fini !"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"content": {"